WEBVTT

00:00:05.418 --> 00:00:08.319
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.089 --> 00:00:11.958
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.958 --> 00:00:14.017
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.861 --> 00:00:18.991
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:23.403
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.403 --> 00:00:25.530
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.306 --> 00:00:30.333
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:32.045 --> 00:00:34.814
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.814 --> 00:00:37.442
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.717 --> 00:00:41.312
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.756 --> 00:00:47.420
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.428 --> 00:00:49.930
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:53.127
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.137
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.137 --> 00:01:01.198
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.441 --> 00:01:06.071
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.847 --> 00:01:09.337
Let's go!

00:01:12.652 --> 00:01:15.985
FORCE OF ONE

00:01:30.437 --> 00:01:34.507
Excellent work, Captain Tylor!
You're a hero to the Force!

00:01:34.507 --> 00:01:38.534
With the empress our prisoner,
the battle is already won!

00:01:38.979 --> 00:01:40.742
Right, Admiral Mifune?

00:01:42.382 --> 00:01:45.318
Anyway, once we have
your report, our forces...

00:01:45.318 --> 00:01:50.756
...will launch an all-out sneak
attack on the Raalgon Empire.

00:01:51.124 --> 00:01:54.651
After all, the empress
is our ace in the hole.

00:01:54.761 --> 00:01:56.695
Whatever happens,
we won't lose!

00:01:56.863 --> 00:01:58.831
You're going to use her
as a trump card?

00:01:59.065 --> 00:02:00.589
A sneak attack?!

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.860
So, would you please
present me to Her Highness?

00:02:04.971 --> 00:02:07.269
I sent her home.

00:02:08.341 --> 00:02:10.866
What do you mean,
"you sent her home"?

00:02:11.244 --> 00:02:14.736
I mean I sent the empress
back to the Raalgon Empire.

00:02:14.814 --> 00:02:18.614
Tha- That's impossible!
You didn't bring her back here?!

00:02:19.185 --> 00:02:19.686
Right.

00:02:19.686 --> 00:02:22.348
You WHAT?! Why, you!

00:02:22.422 --> 00:02:23.156
Admiral!

00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:24.214
Out of my way!

00:02:25.292 --> 00:02:28.693
Captain Tylor,
tell us the reason!

00:02:29.229 --> 00:02:30.856
Why did you send her back?!

00:02:31.131 --> 00:02:33.326
She said she wanted to go back.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.468
So I decided it'd
be best to send her back.

00:02:35.835 --> 00:02:38.963
That was your decision as
a front line officer?!

00:02:39.239 --> 00:02:42.542
People should act the
way they think is best.

00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:45.705
Helps to cut out
stress from your life.

00:02:45.812 --> 00:02:48.280
And you didn't even consider
the consequences?!

00:02:48.882 --> 00:02:53.319
Right. Do your best and let the
rest take care of itself, I say.

00:03:01.094 --> 00:03:04.962
This special court-martial of the
United Planets Space Force...

00:03:05.031 --> 00:03:07.625
...has reached its verdict
on Justy Ueki Tylor!

00:03:09.069 --> 00:03:09.899
It's not fair.

00:03:10.537 --> 00:03:13.700
First, he is stripped of his
rank of lieutenant commander...

00:03:13.873 --> 00:03:16.398
...and removed from command
of the destroyer Soyokaze.

00:03:16.476 --> 00:03:19.934
In addition, for
disrupting the plans...

00:03:20.013 --> 00:03:23.471
...for a United Planets
Space Force operation:

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.279
Death by firing squad!

00:03:26.119 --> 00:03:26.915
It's not fair.

00:03:27.354 --> 00:03:31.450
Sentence to be carried out
tomorrow at 12:00 hours.

00:03:32.525 --> 00:03:33.321
It's not fair.

00:03:41.568 --> 00:03:42.330
It's not fair!

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.970
Did you say
firing squad, sir?!

00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:49.640
It'll be carried out
tomorrow at 12:00 hours.

00:03:49.876 --> 00:03:53.607
You're all finally flee of
that incompetent captain!

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:58.208
Lieutenant Yamamoto, you'll have
command of the Soyokaze.

00:03:58.518 --> 00:04:01.544
Well, people, sit back and
enjoy waiting for tomorrow!

00:04:05.325 --> 00:04:08.761
I've done it. The day I've
been waiting for has come!

00:04:09.162 --> 00:04:11.255
I'm finally the captain!

00:04:14.801 --> 00:04:20.330
Yes... My becoming captain
means Tylor has to!

00:04:20.807 --> 00:04:22.909
I never thought
it'd come to this.

00:04:22.909 --> 00:04:23.876
My God...

00:04:23.977 --> 00:04:26.275
Let's just say it!
The punishment's too severe!

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:30.714
I don't care if it's the high
command's verdict. I don't buy it!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:35.216
But, headquarters has
already made its decision.

00:04:35.955 --> 00:04:38.825
Nothing we say now will
make any difference.

00:04:38.825 --> 00:04:42.192
So, you'd prefer to stand by
and let the captain be killed?!

00:04:42.395 --> 00:04:43.760
That's not what I said!

00:04:43.897 --> 00:04:46.627
But if we don't do something,
the captain will be!

00:04:47.333 --> 00:04:50.791
Commander, you know
it as well as I do.

00:04:51.371 --> 00:04:53.339
The verdict of
a court-martial...

00:04:54.407 --> 00:04:55.738
...is final!

00:05:05.351 --> 00:05:08.013
Look at Her Imperial Highness!

00:05:08.588 --> 00:05:14.220
In answer to our prayers, she has
been returned to us unharmed!

00:05:16.663 --> 00:05:19.097
I tell you all,
fate is moving with us!

00:05:19.632 --> 00:05:22.328
I say now is the time to
gather all of our forces...

00:05:22.402 --> 00:05:25.565
...and smash the foolish United
Planets Space Force once and for all!

00:05:33.613 --> 00:05:34.477
Wait!

00:05:50.463 --> 00:05:52.226
Forgive us, Your Highness.

00:05:52.699 --> 00:05:56.135
Now is not the time to
engage the United Planets!

00:05:56.669 --> 00:05:57.670
Why, you!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:58.466
Leave them!

00:06:00.373 --> 00:06:01.397
Let them speak.

00:06:02.809 --> 00:06:06.279
Wars are won only when you
are sure of your enemy...

00:06:06.279 --> 00:06:09.112
...sure of the timing,
and sure of yourself.

00:06:09.816 --> 00:06:14.446
Fight now, and you risk spilling
much of our own blood needlessly.

00:06:16.523 --> 00:06:19.025
You're saying now
isn't a good time to fight.

00:06:19.025 --> 00:06:19.753
Aye!

00:06:20.293 --> 00:06:22.022
One moment, please, Highness.

00:06:22.896 --> 00:06:26.423
Only they are against this war.

00:06:26.699 --> 00:06:30.499
Don't listen to the opinions
of this fringe group!

00:06:32.005 --> 00:06:36.175
Hear me, all of you! Though Her
Highness has returned unharmed...

00:06:36.175 --> 00:06:40.908
...don't forget that the United
Planets wounded her heart gravely!

00:06:41.247 --> 00:06:45.013
For Her Highness' sake,
we must fight this war!

00:06:45.251 --> 00:06:46.980
For Her Highness' sake!

00:06:47.053 --> 00:06:48.918
Death to the United Planets!

00:06:49.088 --> 00:06:50.248
Death to them!

00:06:54.494 --> 00:06:56.189
Damn you to hell, Wang!

00:07:08.641 --> 00:07:12.702
Dom, help me.
What should I do?

00:07:18.217 --> 00:07:20.014
Aim!

00:07:21.454 --> 00:07:23.183
Fire!

00:07:41.741 --> 00:07:43.072
It's not just a dream.

00:07:44.277 --> 00:07:46.108
In six hours,
the captain will be!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.650
Not here, either.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:03.354
Where is the captain being held?!

00:08:20.179 --> 00:08:23.945
You want to know how
to stop this war?

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:28.851
Yes. Our fleet will soon be
across their defense line.

00:08:29.155 --> 00:08:32.352
If I don't halt the attack now,
nothing will stop this war.

00:08:32.859 --> 00:08:34.690
As you say, Highness.

00:08:35.128 --> 00:08:38.291
I want to do something
before that happens.

00:08:39.832 --> 00:08:43.359
Highness, if you want
to stop this war...

00:08:43.836 --> 00:08:48.796
...then find the courage to say
what is truly in your heart.

00:08:49.709 --> 00:08:51.609
Say what's in my heart?

00:08:52.045 --> 00:08:55.446
Yes. Move as your
heart tells you to...

00:08:56.282 --> 00:08:58.944
...and let fate take
care of the rest.

00:08:59.819 --> 00:09:04.222
Do as my heart tells me and
let fate take care of the rest?

00:09:04.724 --> 00:09:07.493
Yes. Do what you can do...

00:09:07.493 --> 00:09:10.189
...and then wait
for heaven's judgment.

00:09:16.736 --> 00:09:18.499
I'd like to thank you, Dom.

00:09:18.771 --> 00:09:21.365
Things become so clear
when I speak with you.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:35.683
Do as my heart tells me and
let fate take care of the rest.

00:09:38.257 --> 00:09:40.851
First, to do what
needs to be done!

00:10:06.419 --> 00:10:10.947
Tell me, Captain! Tell me what
you'd do if you were here now!

00:10:22.001 --> 00:10:26.062
Right. Do your best and let the
rest take care of itself, I say.

00:10:29.976 --> 00:10:32.103
Commander, what are
you going to do?

00:10:44.857 --> 00:10:45.721
Found him!

00:11:10.983 --> 00:11:13.816
We can't let you go by
yourself, Harumi.

00:11:17.256 --> 00:11:19.451
We're going to save
the captain, too!

00:11:21.994 --> 00:11:24.087
Things will work out, somehow.

00:11:24.463 --> 00:11:26.226
That's what the commander said.

00:11:31.838 --> 00:11:34.830
This dropship's cockpit is
reserved for me, okay?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:41.539
Lieutenant!

00:11:50.289 --> 00:11:52.849
You'd better
not forget about us!

00:11:53.926 --> 00:11:56.986
No way we're letting the Marines
get all the glory on this one!

00:11:57.463 --> 00:11:59.658
I just figured we
were the only ones...

00:11:59.799 --> 00:12:02.290
...with the guts to
take on the brass!

00:12:03.369 --> 00:12:04.358
All of you...

00:12:04.804 --> 00:12:09.298
I'm not the only one. The captain
worked his way into all our hearts.

00:12:17.884 --> 00:12:20.045
Not going, Lieutenant?

00:12:21.153 --> 00:12:26.318
I... I believe in the
high command's decision.

00:12:26.592 --> 00:12:30.050
Hm... Worrying about everything
isn't healthy, you know.

00:12:45.511 --> 00:12:46.944
Just two more hours.

00:13:00.059 --> 00:13:01.617
Right, down the next corridor.

00:13:01.894 --> 00:13:02.588
Hurry!

00:13:06.065 --> 00:13:07.794
The crew of the Soyokaze?!

00:13:08.901 --> 00:13:12.803
Bring Tylor here!
We're executing him now!

00:13:30.856 --> 00:13:33.017
You wish to speak with me?

00:13:33.326 --> 00:13:35.385
Wang, as Goza the 16th...

00:13:35.461 --> 00:13:38.919
...Empress of the Holy Raalgon
Empire, I command you!

00:13:39.465 --> 00:13:41.126
Recall our forces immediately!

00:13:42.735 --> 00:13:45.431
Recall our forces, you say?

00:13:46.105 --> 00:13:48.641
But suppose, Highness,
just suppose...

00:13:48.641 --> 00:13:53.442
...that someone close to you
wishes to take over the Empire?

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:57.310
He could use this to rally
those who don't believe in you.

00:13:57.383 --> 00:14:00.443
Shake the loyalty
of those who do...

00:14:00.519 --> 00:14:04.319
...and rip the
entire empire apart!

00:14:04.824 --> 00:14:07.418
Would that person be you?!

00:14:07.593 --> 00:14:10.391
Oh, no! Not at all!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:14.224
I'm simply
speaking hypothetically.

00:14:17.136 --> 00:14:22.008
Like everyone else, I'm just
thinking of your best interests.

00:14:22.008 --> 00:14:24.033
Please observe, Highness.

00:14:38.924 --> 00:14:42.655
They believe in you, Highness,
and are preparing to fight.

00:14:48.567 --> 00:14:52.503
Do you know what will happen to
the loyalty filling their hearts...

00:14:52.571 --> 00:14:54.732
...if you recall them now?

00:14:55.841 --> 00:14:58.139
Their love for you
will turn to distrust...

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.474
...and that could plunge
this nation into chaos.

00:15:01.213 --> 00:15:04.444
And, in a time of war,
a nation in confusion...

00:15:04.517 --> 00:15:07.179
...would be easy prey
for an enemy invasion.

00:15:07.486 --> 00:15:10.512
In any case, the empire
you inherited...

00:15:10.589 --> 00:15:13.456
...now stands at a critical point.

00:15:19.598 --> 00:15:23.295
Highness, do you still order
our troops to withdraw?

00:15:26.138 --> 00:15:30.507
The avalanche has already begun.
No one can stop it now.

00:15:35.448 --> 00:15:38.611
Damn it! Where are
they hiding him?!

00:15:38.984 --> 00:15:41.578
They might have carried
out the sentence early.

00:15:42.388 --> 00:15:45.186
If only we knew where
they're going to do it.

00:15:45.257 --> 00:15:48.454
The Ho-Oh's too big
to search now!

00:15:56.368 --> 00:16:00.828
Firing squads are usually conducted
in the shooting range in block 3.

00:16:02.007 --> 00:16:04.874
At least, that's what
I heard in the Academy.

00:16:05.644 --> 00:16:06.770
Lieutenant Yamamoto!

00:16:07.079 --> 00:16:08.714
I hate to admit it,
but it looks like...

00:16:08.714 --> 00:16:10.648
...the captain worked his
way into my heart as well.

00:16:37.676 --> 00:16:42.113
Go on, Highness.
Order them all to fight!

00:16:43.282 --> 00:16:48.083
The times are already
shifting in my favor!

00:17:07.039 --> 00:17:07.767
Hurry!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:19.883
Goza the 16th, Empress of the Holy
Raalgon Empire, now commands you!

00:17:21.687 --> 00:17:24.656
In my name, our empire shall
launch an all-out attack...

00:17:24.723 --> 00:17:27.191
...upon the accursed
United Planets Space Force!

00:17:31.931 --> 00:17:34.627
It's done.
Even Her Highness!

00:17:42.575 --> 00:17:43.507
Highness...

00:17:45.077 --> 00:17:46.476
Attack at once!

00:18:06.465 --> 00:18:07.056
Captain!

00:18:07.199 --> 00:18:08.393
Take aim!

00:18:22.181 --> 00:18:22.806
F...

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:25.382
What's happening?!

00:18:30.155 --> 00:18:35.593
Emergency! The Raalgon main fleet
has warped out at point LN-2!

00:18:35.794 --> 00:18:39.252
They've broken through our outer
defense line and are advancing!

00:18:39.932 --> 00:18:41.729
Tha- That's impossible!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.995
The Raalgon moved first?!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:47.573
Enemy main fleet is
closing with our forces...

00:18:47.573 --> 00:18:49.074
...at one-half light speed!

00:18:49.074 --> 00:18:50.974
Number of ships estimated
in excess of 20,000!

00:18:51.076 --> 00:18:55.410
Presence of the enemy flagship
Melva is confirmed among them!

00:18:56.181 --> 00:18:58.417
There's no way we
can fight them now!

00:18:58.417 --> 00:19:01.750
We don't have the empress
to play as a trump card!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:04.354
And I'm telling you
we can't run, either!

00:19:04.423 --> 00:19:08.450
And how do we fight them?!
Tell me your plan, Admiral Mifune!

00:19:09.461 --> 00:19:11.429
If you don't have a plan,
then tell me how...

00:19:11.497 --> 00:19:13.761
...you plan to take
responsibility for all this!

00:19:13.832 --> 00:19:16.460
Well, then, let's hear
your brilliant ideas!

00:19:17.169 --> 00:19:18.537
You go first!

00:19:18.537 --> 00:19:20.027
No, you go first!

00:19:20.105 --> 00:19:21.629
No, you first, Admiral!

00:19:22.508 --> 00:19:24.976
What are you getting
so excited about?

00:19:31.317 --> 00:19:32.181
Captain!

00:19:33.352 --> 00:19:36.788
If the Raalgon are coming,
then leave this to me!

00:19:40.159 --> 00:19:44.619
Give me command of all our
forces and we will not lose!

00:19:44.797 --> 00:19:48.893
Justy Ueki Tylor, age twenty,
swears this here and now!

00:19:50.836 --> 00:19:52.471
Give you command...

00:19:52.471 --> 00:19:54.029
...of all our forces?!

00:19:55.507 --> 00:19:58.908
Well, Tylor was held
captive by the enemy.

00:19:59.111 --> 00:20:02.376
He could have information
vital to our forces.

00:20:02.548 --> 00:20:04.038
I don't care!

00:20:04.283 --> 00:20:08.481
But the Soyokaze engaged the
Melva single-handedly...

00:20:08.554 --> 00:20:11.318
...and managed to come back
here in one piece!

00:20:11.657 --> 00:20:13.682
I don't care! I don't care!

00:20:13.759 --> 00:20:15.351
All right,
then answer me this:

00:20:15.961 --> 00:20:20.399
Has anyone else in our fleet ever
successfully engaged the Melva?!

00:20:20.399 --> 00:20:21.991
Uh, well...

00:20:34.713 --> 00:20:37.511
Enemy fleet has broken through
our last defense line!

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:46.592
There are times
when we're generous.

00:20:46.592 --> 00:20:48.794
We're going to
grant your request...

00:20:48.794 --> 00:20:51.456
...and give you a
chance to clear your name.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:55.801
Along with returning
your command to you...

00:20:55.801 --> 00:21:00.670
...you have special authority
to repel the Raalgon attack!

00:21:01.673 --> 00:21:03.265
You mean, the captain...

00:21:03.609 --> 00:21:05.099
You're not going to kill him?!

00:21:12.017 --> 00:21:13.314
Stuffy in there.

00:21:15.053 --> 00:21:15.883
Captain...

00:21:19.258 --> 00:21:20.657
Captain!

00:21:22.828 --> 00:21:24.819
Mr. Tylor! Mr. Tylor!

00:21:25.197 --> 00:21:26.357
Captain!

00:21:27.566 --> 00:21:29.431
Just like you said, Captain.

00:21:29.935 --> 00:21:32.301
Huh? Did I say something?

00:22:13.879 --> 00:22:14.868
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:16.415 --> 00:22:19.111
In all of history, no war was
ever ended without bloodshed.

00:22:19.284 --> 00:22:20.979
Family. Friends. Lovers.

00:22:21.153 --> 00:22:23.849
With destiny upon his shoulders,
the final battle draws near.

00:22:24.189 --> 00:22:26.453
Next time,
"The Longest Day in Space."

00:22:26.558 --> 00:22:26.792
Watch for it.

00:22:26.792 --> 00:22:27.526
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound
Watch for it.

00:22:27.526 --> 00:22:28.652
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:39.905 --> 00:22:43.008
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:43.008 --> 00:22:46.102
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:46.612 --> 00:22:50.082
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:50.082 --> 00:22:52.915
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:53.418 --> 00:22:56.255
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:56.255 --> 00:23:00.055
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:23:00.859 --> 00:23:03.228
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:03.228 --> 00:23:07.062
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

